<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Union Pacific buy rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Union Pacific buy rated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities initiated coverage of Union Pacific Corp with a buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Friday at 59-1/4.</p>
</text>
